<!--
    Stops MSBuild walking further up to the repository root.

    The root Directory.Build.props exists to ship multitargeted NuGet packages: it sets
    IsPackable, IsPublishable, package metadata and the MultiTarget machinery. Nothing under
    tools/ ships as a package, and these are plain platform-agnostic projects that must build
    on any CI agent without the Uno/WinUI workloads, so they opt out of all of it rather than
    overriding it property by property.
-->
